# SPEC — Spec Platform (the product)

> A spec genome platform. Teams write specs. Platform validates, simulates, and generates code. AI agents query specs at build time via MCP. Sell as SaaS.

---

## Product

Teams define their software using a spec genome. The platform validates that the spec is complete and consistent, simulates scenarios to predict outcomes, and generates production-ready code scaffolding. AI coding agents query specs in real-time via MCP.

One source of truth. Zero ambiguity. Ship with confidence.

### Flow 5: dotdog compiles specs (dogfood)

```
[1/3] Developer writes .dog specs with entities like Node, Task, and Prediction
[2/3] dotdog Compile parses entities and relationships into a DAG graph
[3/3] Compile produces DAG with token savings → AI agent queries via MCP
```

